NOTE ON DATA. This licence covers the source code in this repository only. It
does not cover, and cannot grant any rights to, the chest X-ray datasets the
project trains and evaluates on. Those carry their own terms, and at least one
is not redistributable:

  * Montgomery County and Shenzhen (U.S. National Library of Medicine) --
    released for computer-aided-screening research; cite Jaeger et al. (2014)
    and check the current NLM download terms before redistributing derivatives.
  * RSNA Pneumonia Detection Challenge -- Kaggle competition data; confirm the
    competition rules page before using the images in a public artifact.
  * NIAID TB Portals -- NOT freely redistributable. Access requires a signed
    Data Use Agreement at data.tbportals.niaid.nih.gov.

The aggregated Kaggle mirror folds NIAID-sourced images into a single download
without visibly carrying the DUA forward. Do not treat images inferred as
NIAID-sourced as cleared for redistribution in any public artifact (paper
figures, released degraded-image samples, demos). See docs/phase1_framing.md
section 4 and docs/LIMITATIONS.md.

No images, checkpoints, or derived image data are committed to this repository.
